\pard\tx3600\tx3980\tx4340\fs28\li1500\fc0\cf0 Tests whether the receiver can create an instance of itself from the data represented by pasteboard. Returns YES if the receiver's list of registered NSImageReps includes a class that can handle the data represented by pasteboard. \

